payload.longDescriptionOriginal:
MindMap turns outlines into interactive, collapsible mind maps inside ChatGPT. Paste or describe a topic and MindFlow renders a visual map you can explore with pan/zoom and fullscreen. Click any node for an instant explanation so you can study, plan, onboard, or brainstorm faster.

@MindMap Visualise deep learning topics
@MindMap Visualise dog breeds
@MindMap Mindmap of biological tree of life
